post-it: Wants a good-looking screensaver
symptoms:
	Wants a screensaver
checks:
	No screensaver set
		shows: Display Properties, Screen Saver, says (None); only 3D Pipes fixes it
software steps:
	Right-click the desktop and pick Properties
	Open the Screen Saver tab
	Choose 3D Pipes
	Click Apply or OK
notes:
	"A good looking guy like me needs a good looking screensaver"
